  <text xml:base="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0461.aytolykos.meineke1839-grc1" xml:lang="grc"><body n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0461.aytolykos.meineke1839-grc1" xml:lang="grc"><div type="edition" n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0461.aytolykos.meineke1839-grc1" xml:lang="grc" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0461_aytolykos"><head>ΑΥΤΟΛΥΚΟΣ</head><pb n="446" facs="urn:hathi:hvd.hxjhbd:scan:458" />
            <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="xix" author_heading="EUPOLIDIS" work_heading="Αὐτολύκος" ana="#compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0461-aytolykos-xix">
              <note type="source">Scholiasta Platonis Bekk. p. 331 : <quote>κατεκλήρωσε δὲ (Aristophanes) καὶ τὴν Αἴγιναν, ὡς Θεογένης ἐν τῷ περὶ Αἰγίνης. κωμῳδεῖται δὲ ὅτι καὶ τὸ τῆς Εἰρήνης κολοσσικὸν ἐξῆρεν ἄγαλμα· Εὔπολις Αὐτολύκῳ, Πλάτων Νίκαις.</quote>
              </note>
              <note type="apparatus">Probabile est haec spectare ad Εἰρήνην fabulam, in qua quum Aristophanes ingentem Pacis deae imaginem ex terra effossam spectatorum oculis subiecisset, id ipsum risisse videtur et Eupolis et Plato. Cfr Bergkius Comment. p. 342.</note>
            </div>
            <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="xx_xxii" author_heading="EUPOLIDIS" work_heading="Αὐτολύκος" ana="#compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0461-aytolykos-xx_xxii">
              <note type="source">Athenaeus III p. 89 f: <quote>τὰς δὲ κνίδας ὁ Εὔπολις ἐν Αὐτολύκῳ ἀκαλήφας ὀνομάζει.</quote> — Suidas, <quote>Ἀναφλασμοί: τὰ ἀφροδίσια. Εὔπολις Αὐτολύκῳ.</quote> — Pollux VII 202: <quote>τὸ πορνεύεσθαι ῥῆμα ἐν τῷ πρώτῳ Εὐπόλιδος Αὐτολύκῳ.</quote>
              </note>
            </div>
            <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="xxiii_xxiv" author_heading="EUPOLIDIS" work_heading="Αὐτολύκος" ana="#compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0461-aytolykos-xxiii_xxiv">
              <note type="source">Harpocratio p. 78 13: <quote>καὶ ἐπίπεμπτον εἰώθασι λέγειν τὸ πέμπτον, ὡς καὶ Εὔπολις Αὐτολύκῳ.</quote> — Grammaticus Bekk. Anecd. p. 447 1: <quote>Ἀρρωστήμων. Εὔπολις Αὐτολύκῳ.</quote>
              </note>
            </div>
            <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="xxv_xxvii" author_heading="EUPOLIDIS" work_heading="Αὐτολύκος" ana="#compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0461-aytolykos-xxv_xxvii">
              <note type="source">Antiatticista p. 83 14. <quote>Ἀπρασία: Εὔπολις Αὐτολύκῳ.</quote> — Idem p. 84 21. <quote>Βιασμός: Εὔπολις Αὐτολύκῳ.</quote> — Idem p. 109 12. <quote>Νουθέτησιν: Εὔπολις Αὐτολύκῳ.</quote>
              </note>
              <note type="apparatus">V. Lobeckium ad Phryn. p. 511. V. Lobeckium l. l. p. 513.</note>
            </div>
          </div></body></text></TEI>